## Conventions

### Naming
```
{project}-{env}-{resource}-{identifier}

Exemples:
- myapp-prod-vpc-main
- myapp-dev-rds-primary
- myapp-staging-lambda-processor
```

### Tagging (OBLIGATOIRE)
```hcl
locals {
  common_tags = {
    Project     = "{{PROJECT_NAME}}"
    Environment = var.environment
    ManagedBy   = "terraform"
    Owner       = "thomas"
    CostCenter  = "{{COST_CENTER}}"
  }
}
```

### Modules
- Un module = une responsabilité
- Variables avec types et descriptions
- Outputs documentés
- README.md dans chaque module

### State Management
```hcl
# backend.tf
terraform {
  backend "s3" {
    bucket         = "{{STATE_BUCKET}}"
    key            = "{{PROJECT_NAME}}/{{ENV}}/terraform.tfstate"
    region         = "eu-west-1"
    encrypt        = true
    dynamodb_table = "terraform-locks"
  }
}
```

